# DevOps Workflow Rules

- Always run `terraform plan -out=terraform_plans/{datetime}.tfplan` before any apply
- Never run `terraform destroy` without explicit user confirmation
- All Ansible roles must be idempotent — test with `molecule test`
- No secrets in Terraform state, playbooks, or Helm values — use external secret stores
- Helm releases require `helm lint` and `helm template` dry-run before install/upgrade
- Every session starts with `/start-session` and ends with `/next-session`
